Placing the comma that separates the list argument from `axis=0` on its own line before `axis=0` is an unusual style that is hard to parse at a glance. Move the comma to the end of the closing `]` line:
```python
return np.sum(
    [
        pc * np.outer(ec, ec)
        for ec, pc in zip(self._h0_basis, self._p_c)
    ],
    axis=0,
)
```
